OL,3,A781 migrants arrive in small boats in
OL,4,A2026 record
OL,5,
OL,6,FA total of 781 migrants arrived in 10
OL,7,Fsmall boats on Wednesday, the highest
OL,8,Fnumber for a single day so far this
OL,9,Fyear, Home Office figures show.
OL,11,FSo far this year 18,565 people have
OL,12,Fmade the Channel crossing, which is 42%
OL,13,Flower than the same period in 2025 when
OL,14,F32,188 had crossed in small boats.
OL,16,FThe government said its "progress this
OL,17,Fyear in tackling small boats is
OL,18,Findisputable" but it needed to "push
OL,19,Ffurther and harder in order to
OL,20,Feradicate this vile trade".
