OL,3,A781 migrants arrive in small boats in
OL,4,A2026 record
OL,5,
OL,6,FFrench authorities reported on Thursday
OL,7,Fthat a man had died after having a
OL,8,Fcardiac arrest while people attempted
OL,9,Fto board a vessel at a beach south of
OL,10,FBoulogne-sur-Mer.
